st of 729 random tries; DSR 0.539. 67% of its P&L is the top 1% of days.", "actionable": "(1) 1-minute data is the only test that settles this. (2) Full-size NQ instead of MNQ moves the cost floor from 1.74 to 0.62 pts. (3) 09:30-11:00 NY is the only positive window on the honest model, but it failed the holdout at p 0.2225 on 177 trades.", "pine_defect": "inSession gates entries only; the script has no session exit, so positions can run past the window (longest 85 bars). Worth ~1% of P&L but not what the description says.", "engine_verification": "truncation 0.0e+00, execution alignment clean, Wilder ATR/RSI to 1e-13, leakage audit no critical or warning findings, no same-bar execution signature.", "id": "N0004"}
